      "",
      "I asked Apple, “Is Chacha going to give us ‘paradise’? When will he come? When will he do this?”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “I don’t know.”",
      "",
      "When people live in the ‘paradise’ world, people listen to their phones, people listen to us.",
      "Good heavens, when? When will Chacha come to our home? When will he do this?",
      "What will happen to Daxing? I … I need to help Daxing!",
      "",
